`2result.sql` is the only query that  
1. ranks the 2021 categories correctly (the list includes COCKTAILS/RTD and both TEMPORARY & SPECIALTY PACKAGES codes, which are indeed separate category codes),  
2. keeps the ranking logic consistent by grouping on the canonical `category` code (not just `category_name`, which merges different codes and drops COCKTAILS/RTD), and  
3. returns the required three‑year averages for the exact same ten category codes.

The other two queries omit COCKTAILS/RTD and therefore do not represent the genuine top‑10 set for 2021.

```plaintext
2result.sql
```